OL,3,AJay-Z rape accuser says her allegation
OL,4,Awas false
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who accused Jay-Z of raping her
OL,7,Fwhen she was 13 has formally said her
OL,8,Fallegation was untrue.
OL,10,FThe unnamed woman filed a lawsuit in
OL,11,F2024 claiming she had been drugged and
OL,12,Fraped by Jay-Z, real name Shawn Carter,
OL,13,Fand Sean "Diddy" Combs at a party after
OL,14,Fthe MTV Video Music Awards in 2000.
OL,16,FThe stars denied the allegation and she
OL,17,Fdropped the lawsuit last year. Carter
OL,18,Fthen sued her and her lawyers.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
